Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:31.68,Main,and a city so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:34.88,Main,it looked like a
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.12,Main,dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:38.33,Main,It was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:41.79,Main,And for one quiet
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:43.51,Main,morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:48.44,Main,the mightiest soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.44,0:05:52.39,Main,in the world forgot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.39,0:05:54.85,Main,how to speak.
